            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.60</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Inpainting always available.</b> The brush button in the preview no longer depends on the selected image model. Remove, Replace and Expand work on any image.</li>
<li><b>New image models.</b> Muse Image, Muse Image Edit and Fibo Edit 1.5.</li>
<li><b>Price updates.</b> Balanced Ideogram edits and expands now cost 41 credits instead of 81.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
