        <item>
            <title>5.59</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 19:09:20 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>351</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.59</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.59</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Edits open in place.</b> While a remove, replace or expand is running, the preview shows a progress badge, and it switches to the result when done. No need to close and reopen.</li>
<li><b>Smarter Replace masking.</b> The mask adapts to what was generated: objects render completely with crisp edges, interior gaps get closed, and everything outside your selection stays pixel-identical to the original, faces included.</li>
<li><b>Typing fix.</b> Keyboard shortcuts like P for favorite no longer fire while you are typing in the replace or expand prompt.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
